<span data-as="p">The orderbook response is wrapped in an <code>orderbook_fp</code> object containing two arrays of bids: <code>yes_dollars</code> for YES positions and <code>no_dollars</code> for NO positions. Each bid is a two-element string array: <code>[price_dollars, count_fp]</code>.</span>
<ul>
<li><strong><code>price_dollars</code></strong>: Price as a dollar string (e.g., <code>&quot;0.4200&quot;</code> = $0.42)</li>
<li><strong><code>count_fp</code></strong>: Number of contracts as a fixed-point string (e.g., <code>&quot;13.00&quot;</code> = 13 contracts)</li>
