<ul>
<li><strong>First element</strong>: Price in dollars as a string (e.g., <code>&quot;0.4200&quot;</code>)</li>
<li><strong>Second element</strong>: Number of contracts as a fixed-point string (e.g., <code>&quot;13.00&quot;</code>)</li>
